    {
      "id": "759b6c91aaaa8564",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "[类型 1: 对于简单离心率问题, 可以通过圆锥曲线的定义与相关性质直接求解得到 a, b, c 的关系式.](%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%AD/%E8%AF%BE%E5%A0%82%E5%90%8C%E6%AD%A5/%E9%A2%98%E5%BA%93/%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%AD%E6%95%B0%E5%AD%A6%E5%85%A8%E7%BB%83%E4%B8%80%E6%9C%AC%E9%80%9A/%E5%9C%86%E9%94%A5%E6%9B%B2%E7%BA%BF/%E7%AC%AC%E5%8D%81%E8%8A%82%20%E4%B8%93%E9%A2%98%3A%20%E5%9C%86%E9%94%A5%E6%9B%B2%E7%BA%BF%E7%A6%BB%E5%BF%83%E7%8E%87%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98%E4%B8%93%E7%BB%83/%E9%A2%98%E7%9B%AE/%E7%B1%BB%E5%9E%8B%201_%20%E5%AF%B9%E4%BA%8E%E7%AE%80%E5%8D%95%E7%A6%BB%E5%BF%83%E7%8E%87%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98%2C%20%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E9%80%9A%E8%BF%87%E5%9C%86%E9%94%A5%E6%9B%B2%E7%BA%BF%E7%9A%84%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%E4%B8%8E%E7%9B%B8%E5%85%B3%E6%80%A7%E8%B4%A8%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E6%B1%82%E8%A7%A3%E5%BE%97%E5%88%B0%20a%2C%20b%2C%20c%20%E7%9A%84%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E5%BC%8F/%E7%B1%BB%E5%9E%8B%201_%20%E5%AF%B9%E4%BA%8E%E7%AE%80%E5%8D%95%E7%A6%BB%E5%BF%83%E7%8E%87%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98%2C%20%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E9%80%9A%E8%BF%87%E5%9C%86%E9%94%A5%E6%9B%B2%E7%BA%BF%E7%9A%84%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%E4%B8%8E%E7%9B%B8%E5%85%B3%E6%80%A7%E8%B4%A8%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E6%B1%82%E8%A7%A3%E5%BE%97%E5%88%B0%20a%2C%20b%2C%20c%20%E7%9A%84%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E5%BC%8F..md)",
