    {
      "id": "aa1d9b4be2d6b12f",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "[类型 3: 利用圆锥曲线的有界性, 可以得到 a, b, c 的不等式关系, 往往用于求离心率取值范围的题型.](%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%AD/%E8%AF%BE%E5%A0%82%E5%90%8C%E6%AD%A5/%E9%A2%98%E5%BA%93/%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%AD%E6%95%B0%E5%AD%A6%E5%85%A8%E7%BB%83%E4%B8%80%E6%9C%AC%E9%80%9A/%E5%9C%86%E9%94%A5%E6%9B%B2%E7%BA%BF/%E7%AC%AC%E5%8D%81%E8%8A%82%20%E4%B8%93%E9%A2%98%3A%20%E5%9C%86%E9%94%A5%E6%9B%B2%E7%BA%BF%E7%A6%BB%E5%BF%83%E7%8E%87%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98%E4%B8%93%E7%BB%83/%E9%A2%98%E7%9B%AE/%E7%B1%BB%E5%9E%8B%203_%20%E5%88%A9%E7%94%A8%E5%9C%86%E9%94%A5%E6%9B%B2%E7%BA%BF%E7%9A%84%E6%9C%89%E7%95%8C%E6%80%A7%2C%20%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E5%BE%97%E5%88%B0%20a%2C%20b%2C%20c%20%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%8D%E7%AD%89%E5%BC%8F%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%2C%20%E5%BE%80%E5%BE%80%E7%94%A8%E4%BA%8E%E6%B1%82%E7%A6%BB%E5%BF%83%E7%8E%87%E5%8F%96%E5%80%BC%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4%E7%9A%84%E9%A2%98%E5%9E%8B/%E7%B1%BB%E5%9E%8B%203_%20%E5%88%A9%E7%94%A8%E5%9C%86%E9%94%A5%E6%9B%B2%E7%BA%BF%E7%9A%84%E6%9C%89%E7%95%8C%E6%80%A7%2C%20%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E5%BE%97%E5%88%B0%20a%2C%20b%2C%20c%20%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%8D%E7%AD%89%E5%BC%8F%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%2C%20%E5%BE%80%E5%BE%80%E7%94%A8%E4%BA%8E%E6%B1%82%E7%A6%BB%E5%BF%83%E7%8E%87%E5%8F%96%E5%80%BC%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4%E7%9A%84%E9%A2%98%E5%9E%8B..md)",
