    {
      "id": "48dd3f59d4456abd",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "[类型 5: 坐标法也是处理离心率的一种方法, 可将向量比例等问题转化为坐标形式, 在坐标系中建立数量关系. 也可采用联立方程的方式, 得到交点坐标的关系式, 通过坐标关系找到 a, b, c 的数量关系.](%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%AD/%E8%AF%BE%E5%A0%82%E5%90%8C%E6%AD%A5/%E9%A2%98%E5%BA%93/%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%AD%E6%95%B0%E5%AD%A6%E5%85%A8%E7%BB%83%E4%B8%80%E6%9C%AC%E9%80%9A/%E5%9C%86%E9%94%A5%E6%9B%B2%E7%BA%BF/%E7%AC%AC%E5%8D%81%E8%8A%82%20%E4%B8%93%E9%A2%98%3A%20%E5%9C%86%E9%94%A5%E6%9B%B2%E7%BA%BF%E7%A6%BB%E5%BF%83%E7%8E%87%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98%E4%B8%93%E7%BB%83/%E9%A2%98%E7%9B%AE/%E7%B1%BB%E5%9E%8B%205_%20%E5%9D%90%E6%A0%87%E6%B3%95%E4%B9%9F%E6%98%AF%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%E7%A6%BB%E5%BF%83%E7%8E%87%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%80%E7%A7%8D%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%95%2C%20%E5%8F%AF%E5%B0%86%E5%90%91%E9%87%8F%E6%AF%94%E4%BE%8B%E7%AD%89%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98%E8%BD%AC%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%BA%E5%9D%90%E6%A0%87%E5%BD%A2%E5%BC%8F%2C%20%E5%9C%A8%E5%9D%90%E6%A0%87%E7%B3%BB%E4%B8%AD%E5%BB%BA%E7%AB%8B%E6%95%B0%E9%87%8F%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB.%20%E4%B9%9F%E5%8F%AF%E9%87%87%E7%94%A8%E8%81%94%E7%AB%8B%E6%96%B9%E7%A8%8B%E7%9A%84%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%2C%20%E5%BE%97%E5%88%B0%E4%BA%A4%E7%82%B9%E5%9D%90%E6%A0%87%E7%9A%84%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E5%BC%8F%2C%20%E9%80%9A/%E7%B1%BB%E5%9E%8B%205_%20%E5%9D%90%E6%A0%87%E6%B3%95%E4%B9%9F%E6%98%AF%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%E7%A6%BB%E5%BF%83%E7%8E%87%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%80%E7%A7%8D%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%95%2C%20%E5%8F%AF%E5%B0%86%E5%90%91%E9%87%8F%E6%AF%94%E4%BE%8B%E7%AD%89%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98%E8%BD%AC%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%BA%E5%9D%90%E6%A0%87%E5%BD%A2%E5%BC%8F%2C%20%E5%9C%A8%E5%9D%90%E6%A0%87%E7%B3%BB%E4%B8%AD%E5%BB%BA%E7%AB%8B%E6%95%B0%E9%87%8F%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB.md)",
